---
import SectionShell from '../SectionShell.astro';
---

<SectionShell id="about" title="About me" kicker="About">
  <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr]">
    <div class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">
      <p>
        I&rsquo;m Kiran, a software engineer based in Bengaluru who has worked across mobile,
        frontend, and backend. These days I focus on distributed systems and platform infrastructure
        at Juniper Square, building the workflow and permissions machinery that other engineering
        teams rely on.
      </p>
      <p>
        Before that I helped build an internal AI agentic-workflow platform at Blue Yonder and
        shipped mobile features for Simplifi at Quicken. I care about systems that stay
        understandable as they grow, and I&rsquo;m always chasing the next thing to learn. Learning
        is a journey, not a destination.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-6">
      <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-ink uppercase">Education</h3>
      <dl class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-sm">
        <dt class="text-ink">B.E., Computer Science &amp; Engineering</dt>
        <dd class="text-muted">BMS College of Engineering &middot; 2016 to 2020</dd>
      </dl>

      <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-ink uppercase">
        Publication
      </h3>
      <dl class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-sm">
        <dt class="text-ink">Pneumonia Detection: An Efficient Approach Using Deep Learning</dt>
        <dd class="text-muted">ICCCNT 2020, IEEE Kharagpur Section</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</SectionShell>
